stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> OPEN: M1 period opened
    OPEN --> INPUTS_CLOSED: M2 close inputs and freeze the snapshot
    INPUTS_CLOSED --> OPEN: M3 reopen inputs, before lock only
    INPUTS_CLOSED --> PROCESSED: M4 process with the evaluation context
    PROCESSED --> PROCESSED: M5 reprocess and diff
    PROCESSED --> OPEN: M3 reopen inputs to change them
    PROCESSED --> APPROVED: M6 checker approves, no blocking validation
    APPROVED --> PROCESSED: M7 return for correction
    APPROVED --> LOCKED: M8 lock, publish payslips, bank file
    LOCKED --> DISBURSED: M9 payment approver releases salaries
    DISBURSED --> PAYMENT_INITIATED: M10 verification gate passed, statutory payment initiated
    PAYMENT_INITIATED --> FILED: M11 every monthly filing instance FILED
    FILED --> [*]

    state "Correction run - a diff against the locked snapshot" as CORRECTION
    LOCKED --> CORRECTION: M12 correction needed
    DISBURSED --> CORRECTION: M12
    PAYMENT_INITIATED --> CORRECTION: M12
    FILED --> CORRECTION: M12

    note right of LOCKED
      Reversible before LOCKED.
      Immutable from LOCKED onward.
    end note

    note right of PAYMENT_INITIATED
      The statutory verification gate sits
      immediately before this state - EV-037.
      After it, no Revised ECR is possible.
    end note

    note left of CORRECTION
      Runs its own OPEN to FILED cycle.
      Filings route by the EV-037 guards,
      the fenced arrear flow, or a
      Form 138 correction statement.
      The locked month stays byte-identical.
    end note
